    "voice": "produce_events/701800107/7018001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7018001070020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……でも本番はこれからだし\r\n気を引き締めなくちゃね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701800107/7018001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、冷静だな\r\nもしかして、あんまり嬉しくないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7018001070030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "うっさい！\r\n……そういうこと言わないで",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701800107/7018001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7018001070040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……ほんとは、飛び跳ねたいくらい嬉しいの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701800107/7018001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7018001070050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "でも、喜ぶのは『W.I.N.G.』で優勝するまで\r\nとっとくことにしたの",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701800107/7018001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7018001070060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だから、本当に喜ぶのは優勝した時だけ\r\nこんなところでなんか、喜んでやらないんだから",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701800107/7018001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、冬優子らしいな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7018001070070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……言っとくけど、あんたもだから",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701800107/7018001070070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7018001070080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたも、この後『W.I.N.G.』で優勝して\r\n好きなだけ喜ばせてあげる",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
